cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "simpleaudiospectral: spectral analysis for verifying lossless audio"
abstract: >-
  Self-hosted web application that detects fake lossless audio (lossy
  transcodes, upsampled hi-res, padded bit depth) from the spectrogram, names
  the likely source codec from encoder lowpass data, and measures loudness,
  true peak and dynamic range.
authors:
  - alias: fishingpvalues
type: software
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/fishingpvalues/simpleaudiospectral"
keywords:
  - fake lossless detection
  - transcode detection
  - spectrogram
  - FLAC
  - lossy compression detection
  - audio forensics
